{"seq":1,"slug":"life-and-times","title":"埃隆·马斯克·生平与时代","stage":"DONE","category":"elon-musk","categoryLabel":"埃隆·马斯克","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/life-and-times","rating":{"composite":3.69,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/33_elon-musk/1_life-and-times","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"埃隆-马斯克-生平与时代\">埃隆·马斯克·生平与时代</h1><p>本 hub 是马斯克系列的<strong>传记主线（时间轴）</strong>：按时间顺序讲清他「从哪来、怎么一步步走到今天」——出生、成长、求学、两次互联网套现、转向硬科技的豪赌、以及帝国的崛起与扩张。它回答的是「<strong>何时发生了什么、为什么这么选</strong>」，把分散的事件整合为一条可解释的因果链。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-vs-兄弟-hub-分工边界\">本 hub vs 兄弟 hub：分工边界</h2><p>本 hub <strong>只管时间轴与抉择</strong>，不深挖工程细节、思维方法或功过评判——后者交给兄弟 hub，正文以相对路径交叉链接，避免重复展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>想了解</th>\n<th>去这个 hub</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>各公司的技术成就与贡献</td>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第一性原理、工作哲学、使命驱动</td>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表作品（猎鹰/星舰/星链/特斯拉车型）</td>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">代表作品</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对产业、商业与文化的影响</td>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>言行/商业争议与多方评价</td>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径与前置\">推荐学习路径与前置</h2><p>无硬性前置知识。建议<strong>按章节编号顺序通读</strong>——三章是严格时间轴，后章的因果依赖前章：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"early-life-and-education/\">早年与教育</a>（1971—1995）→ 性格与「物理+经济」跨学科认知模板的来源；</li>\n<li><a href=\"early-ventures/\">创业起步</a>（1995—2008）→ 互联网资本如何变成硬科技豪赌的燃料；</li>\n<li><a href=\"building-an-empire/\">商业帝国</a>（2008—2026）→ 绝境逢生后的崛起与多元扩张。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>读完想追问「他凭什么这么判断」，转 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/first-principles/\">思想与方法·第一性原理</a>；想要功过定论，转 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/diverse-appraisals/\">争议与评价·多元评判</a>。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"early-life-and-education","title":"早年与教育","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/life-and-times/early-life-and-education","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"childhood-in-south-africa","title":"南非的童年","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/life-and-times/early-life-and-education/childhood-in-south-africa"},{"seq":2,"slug":"education-and-emigration","title":"求学与移民","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/life-and-times/early-life-and-education/education-and-emigration"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"early-ventures","title":"创业起步","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/life-and-times/early-ventures","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"zip2-and-paypal","title":"Zip2 与 PayPal","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/life-and-times/early-ventures/zip2-and-paypal"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-leap-to-space-and-cars","title":"转向航天与汽车","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/life-and-times/early-ventures/the-leap-to-space-and-cars"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"building-an-empire","title":"商业帝国","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/life-and-times/building-an-empire","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-tesla-and-spacex-years","title":"特斯拉与 SpaceX 的岁月","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/life-and-times/building-an-empire/the-tesla-and-spacex-years"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-multi-company-mogul","title":"多元帝国的掌舵者","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/life-and-times/building-an-empire/the-multi-company-mogul"}]}]}